{
  "version": 1,
  "spec": "spec/ZENOHO2-V1-SPEC.md sections 4, 5, 9",
  "notes": [
    "All local times are IST (tzOffsetMin 330) unless a case says otherwise.",
    "The hr field is a generator so coverage ratios can be stated exactly rather than",
    "listing hundreds of samples. mode=none emits nothing. mode=cover emits a sample",
    "every everyMin across [startIso,endIso). mode=buckets emits one sample in the",
    "middle of each of the first bucketCount 30-minute buckets from startIso, which is",
    "how a precise wear-presence ratio is produced. recordingMethod defaults to",
    "AUTOMATIC and applies to every generated sample (D-019).",
    "kind=derive exercises deriveDailyState; kind=revision exercises applyRevision."
  ],
